1
00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:35,050
[In my prime]

2
00:01:35,370 --> 00:01:37,729
[Episode 20]

3
00:01:39,590 --> 00:01:40,039
Dad,

4
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,789
why did you lie to me?

5
00:01:44,060 --> 00:01:45,259
I didn't exactly lie.

6
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:46,950
I only meant to wait

7
00:01:46,950 --> 00:01:49,280
a bit longer before telling you the truth.

8
00:01:49,870 --> 00:01:51,530
I was afraid you'd be affected

9
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,070
when you knew it.

10
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,470
Cao Xin,

11
00:01:55,990 --> 00:01:57,190
don't feel burdened.

12
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,509
This matter has nothing to do with you.

13
00:01:59,509 --> 00:01:59,970
Look...

14
00:02:00,230 --> 00:02:01,680
Our house was practically

15
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,760
falling apart.

16
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:05,290
It's a good thing that I sold it early.

17
00:02:05,510 --> 00:02:06,870
Now, I'm living at Si's place
while helping

18
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:08,330
her take care of her child.

19
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,240
How very nice.

20
00:02:18,030 --> 00:02:18,470
Dad.

21
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:21,440
I've made up my mind.

22
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:24,280
I'm not going abroad.

23
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,640
You're not going abroad?

24
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,590
After four years of hard work,

25
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:33,910
you finally got into grad school.

26
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:35,570
And now you're giving up on it?

27
00:02:36,910 --> 00:02:37,520
Yes, I am.

28
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,079
I've decided.

29
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,000
Alright, Cao Xin.

30
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:44,560
It is

31
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,520
really late now.

32
00:02:46,030 --> 00:02:47,520
Let's go home for some rest.

33
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,560
You need to calm down.

34
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,090
Let's go.

35
00:02:49,150 --> 00:02:49,520
Dad.

36
00:02:50,650 --> 00:02:51,680
I didn't say that on impulse

37
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,630
or out of anger.

38
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:57,190
I've been thinking about this

39
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:57,840
since the day I got

40
00:02:57,840 --> 00:03:00,640
the admission letter
from Macdonald University.

41
00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:02,360
I want to take charge of my own life

42
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,160
for just once.

43
00:03:05,140 --> 00:03:06,560
Take charge of your own life

44
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,460
for just once?

45
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:09,430
Does that conflict with your education?

46
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:10,560
I'd really hate to have you,

47
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,420
Grandpa, and Si

48
00:03:12,690 --> 00:03:14,280
live in misery for the rest of your lives

49
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,190
because of me.

50
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,260
Grandpa is really old now,

51
00:03:20,870 --> 00:03:23,400
yet he has to leave his hometown
because of me.

52
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,090
Doesn't he want

53
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,050
to plant flowers

54
00:03:27,190 --> 00:03:28,190
and bask in the sun

55
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:29,560
in our hometown?

56
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:32,650
And look at you, working
as a security guard,

57
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:34,280
braving the weather and catering

58
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,590
to other people's moods.

59
00:03:35,590 --> 00:03:36,720
Cao Xin, enough.

60
00:03:36,870 --> 00:03:37,840
We are willing

61
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:39,030
to do all of this.

62
00:03:39,060 --> 00:03:41,280
And we're doing it of our own accord.

63
00:03:41,750 --> 00:03:43,590
I've always been catering
to other people's moods

64
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:44,400
and I've got used to it

65
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,660
over these many years.

66
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,240
That's why I hoped you could

67
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,120
put your heart

68
00:03:48,140 --> 00:03:48,940
into studies,

69
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:50,680
go to a great college,

70
00:03:50,710 --> 00:03:51,910
and find a good job,

71
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,880
so you would have a decent life

72
00:03:53,910 --> 00:03:55,750
and never have to cater to anyone.

73
00:03:55,750 --> 00:03:57,750
I wish for you to hold your head high

74
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,360
and walk a path

75
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,520
to prosperity

76
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,890
that I never got to walk.

77
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:03,750
Cao Xin.

78
00:04:06,030 --> 00:04:07,190
Call me selfish

79
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:09,090
or narrow-minded if you like.

80
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:11,150
I just want to do everything I can

81
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,780
to send you out of here.

82
00:04:13,910 --> 00:04:15,910
I want you to make something of yourself.

83
00:04:15,910 --> 00:04:17,630
I want you to achieve success.

84
00:04:19,430 --> 00:04:20,510
Do it for my sake,

85
00:04:21,269 --> 00:04:21,829
will you?

86
00:04:26,390 --> 00:04:26,920
Dad,

87
00:04:28,390 --> 00:04:29,720
what does success mean?

88
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:32,250
What does it mean
to make something of myself?

89
00:04:33,850 --> 00:04:35,240
In my opinion, what matters is

90
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,290
that our whole family lives

91
00:04:36,290 --> 00:04:38,100
happily together every day.

92
00:04:38,390 --> 00:04:40,140
Only that is the foundation of success.

93
00:04:40,140 --> 00:04:40,890
Cao Xin,

94
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:43,720
everyone says that a good man's ambition
reaches far and wide.

95
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,430
But look at you...

96
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:45,760
That's why I envy Qi Shi.

97
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,750
It's true that she didn't go to college,

98
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:51,950
but in these four years,

99
00:04:51,950 --> 00:04:53,950
she managed to open a clothing store

100
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:56,030
through her own efforts,

101
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:00,750
Indeed, it was a rough journey,

102
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:03,950
but she must have found joy,

103
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:07,890
because she chose this path herself.

104
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,360
Up till today,

105
00:05:11,390 --> 00:05:12,000
I've never been

106
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,270
happy about getting a scholarship

107
00:05:13,270 --> 00:05:14,870
from Macdonald University,

108
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,120
because I didn't choose any of that.

109
00:05:20,330 --> 00:05:21,480
It was a path that you chose

110
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,390
for me long ago.

111
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,770
Since I was little, I've always

112
00:05:28,770 --> 00:05:29,430
told myself

113
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,640
that I must listen to you,

114
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:34,040
be a good son,

115
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,750
and do everything you said.

116
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,580
Do you remember

117
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,080
that when Qi Shi was eight

118
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:48,130
and about to start elementary school,

119
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,100
you took us both

120
00:05:49,110 --> 00:05:50,510
to the stationery store?

121
00:05:51,510 --> 00:05:52,840
Qi Shi asked for a toy.

122
00:05:57,740 --> 00:05:58,360
I was actually

123
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,890
the one who wanted that toy.

124
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:04,240
I asked Qi Shi to get it for me,

125
00:06:06,270 --> 00:06:08,200
because I dared not to do so myself.

126
00:06:11,950 --> 00:06:12,480
Therefore, now,

127
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,800
I want to take charge of my own life

128
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,750
for just once.

129
00:06:16,070 --> 00:06:16,390
Dad.

130
00:06:18,430 --> 00:06:19,120
Cao Xin,

131
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:22,750
I understand everything

132
00:06:23,390 --> 00:06:24,510
you're saying.

133
00:06:25,390 --> 00:06:27,040
But sometimes,

134
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:29,950
it's wrong to be willful.

135
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:33,010
You should be more considerate of others,

136
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,159
alright?

137
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:39,800
Fine.

138
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,350
I get it now.

139
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,630
You've grown up

140
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,890
and you have your own ideas.

141
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,380
You don't need me anymore.

142
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:58,680
Dad.

143
00:07:01,750 --> 00:07:03,410
It's not that I don't need you.

144
00:07:06,870 --> 00:07:08,000
I'm just feeling...

145
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:11,690
now that I'm gradually growing up

146
00:07:14,890 --> 00:07:16,000
I hope I can become someone

147
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,060
who you can rely on.

148
00:08:00,390 --> 00:08:01,190
Let's go home.

149
00:08:08,310 --> 00:08:08,720
Dad.

150
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,830
Actually, the sweater Mrs. Huo knitted

151
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,390
is quite cozy.

152
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,940
The one you knitted...

153
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,000
is too tight.

154
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,560
You little brat.

155
00:08:22,510 --> 00:08:24,310
Looking down on your old man now?

156
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:25,720
No,

157
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,330
I'm just stating a fact.

158
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:33,640
Here, your clothes.

159
00:08:34,150 --> 00:08:35,010
Thirty, right?

160
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:36,330
Do come back again.

161
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,940
-Thirty yuan for you.
-There are new arrivals every week.

162
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:39,270
Come again whenever you feel like.

163
00:08:39,270 --> 00:08:39,600
Sure.

164
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:41,799
You... you...

165
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,080
Come here!

166
00:08:46,460 --> 00:08:47,080
Your business

167
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,140
is really booming.

168
00:08:48,630 --> 00:08:50,390
So busy that you're having lunch
this late.

169
00:08:50,390 --> 00:08:52,050
There have been better times.

170
00:08:54,890 --> 00:08:56,080
Watch out for that plump woman

171
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:56,790
next door.

172
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:59,240
It seems she's not to be trifled with.

173
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,910
Especially since you got here,

174
00:09:00,910 --> 00:09:03,110
her business has obviously taken a hit.

175
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,390
I gave out gifts

176
00:09:05,910 --> 00:09:06,320
to

177
00:09:06,910 --> 00:09:09,000
the neighbors when I opened this shop.

178
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,730
Everyone was pretty friendly.

179
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,220
Hua, the owner next door,

180
00:09:12,220 --> 00:09:13,080
even suggested

181
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,540
we look out for each other.

182
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:15,510
Only this plump lady

183
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:17,110
sees me as a thorn in her side.

184
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:19,780
Tell me.

185
00:09:20,510 --> 00:09:21,390
Isn't the key to doing

186
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:23,270
business lies in one's own skills?

187
00:09:23,270 --> 00:09:23,910
Can hatred

188
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,240
help with anything?

189
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:27,330
Will it make her business any better?

190
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,610
I don't know if it'll get better.

191
00:09:28,610 --> 00:09:29,550
But ever since you showed up,

192
00:09:29,550 --> 00:09:30,360
her business is clearly

193
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,090
going under.

194
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,270
When people can't get first place,

195
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:35,960
they blame those who can
for being too good.

196
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,820
Classic Cao the Second thinking.

197
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:43,610
Cao Xin was going to study abroad,

198
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:45,550
but he gave up in the end.

199
00:09:45,550 --> 00:09:47,750
He's getting prepared to find a job now.

200
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:53,450
Even Cao the Second has made progress.

201
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:54,960
How is that any progress?

202
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,360
He had been always

203
00:09:56,790 --> 00:09:57,480
suppressed

204
00:09:58,270 --> 00:09:59,870
by his dad at home

205
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,770
and by me at school since he was a kid.

206
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:05,550
He never lived for himself
for a single day.

207
00:10:05,550 --> 00:10:07,480
I believe he must have gone through

208
00:10:08,270 --> 00:10:08,910
a lot of

209
00:10:09,290 --> 00:10:10,600
inner struggle before he made

210
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,800
such a huge decision.

211
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,030
Qi Shi,

212
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,840
you know what?

213
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,720
Actually, you and Cao Xin

214
00:10:18,050 --> 00:10:19,710
can make a pretty good couple.

215
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:22,350
D-Don't you speak nonsense.

216
00:10:22,550 --> 00:10:23,790
It's been ages since I last saw him.

217
00:10:23,790 --> 00:10:25,240
How are we supposed to make a good couple?

218
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:25,770
Exactly.

219
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,080
It's been ages since you last saw him.

220
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:27,480
Why are you

221
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,280
still refusing to meet with him?

222
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:33,790
I'm not refusing it. I just don't see

223
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,100
any necessity.

224
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,030
How is that

225
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:40,980
even an excuse? You two are friends.

226
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:41,690
He has never

227
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,180
stopped caring about you.

228
00:10:43,550 --> 00:10:45,270
Tian Zihao told me that Cao Xin even

229
00:10:45,270 --> 00:10:46,320
sent you a flower basket

230
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,780
when you opened this shop.

231
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,600
I know.

232
00:10:51,810 --> 00:10:52,360
Sometimes,

233
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,560
Cao Xin even texts me.

234
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,970
The more honest

235
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,200
and unbothered he is,

236
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:00,000
the more ashamed I feel.

237
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,550
I can lose to anyone,

238
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,690
except him.

239
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,980
I just won't accept it.

240
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:07,400
The truth is,

241
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:09,000
ever since he got into

242
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,200
Beining University,

243
00:11:10,750 --> 00:11:12,080
he's left me far behind.

244
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:13,550
He and I are

245
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:16,340
worlds apart now.

246
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:19,240
He's not going abroad for studies.

247
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,650
And you have your career now.

248
00:11:20,650 --> 00:11:21,310
How is there

249
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:23,050
a big gap between the two of you?

250
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,760
Have you heard

251
00:11:27,510 --> 00:11:29,510
of this? "Things change over time."

252
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,960
Cao Xin and I have

253
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,080
already missed

254
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,670
our chance.

255
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:38,960
Of course,

256
00:11:40,270 --> 00:11:41,240
maybe we're back

257
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:43,480
to the same starting point now.

258
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:45,430
And who knows?

259
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,200
Perhaps one day,

260
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,800
our paths might cross again.

261
00:12:09,790 --> 00:12:10,630
Please make way!

262
00:12:10,630 --> 00:12:11,490
Let me through!

263
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:12,530
Make way.

264
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:23,000
Let me through!

265
00:12:50,610 --> 00:12:54,560
♪ Who hasn't panicked
in this fast-paced world? ♪

266
00:12:56,800 --> 00:13:03,680
♪ All I see is the look in your eyes ♪

267
00:13:03,700 --> 00:13:08,430
♪ If there's nothing left tomorrow ♪

268
00:13:10,710 --> 00:13:21,260
♪ I'll still walk you home ♪

269
00:13:14,550 --> 00:13:15,550
Here you are, sir.

270
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,360
Didn't we agree on 15?

271
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,080
Round it down.

272
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,740
I'll hire your service again.

273
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:21,120
Thanks, sir.

274
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:23,730
Bye. Wish you a booming business.

275
00:13:39,830 --> 00:13:40,750
My phone!

276
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:45,240
Thank you.

277
00:13:53,550 --> 00:13:54,070
Qi Shi!

278
00:14:09,110 --> 00:14:09,840
Qi Shi!

279
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:54,800
Miss,

280
00:14:55,030 --> 00:14:55,760
look at this.

281
00:14:56,510 --> 00:14:57,120
It's a new arrival.

282
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,320
I think it suits you perfectly.

283
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,480
Look, try it against yourself.

284
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,410
A cute camisole.

285
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:02,270
I think it looks great on you.

286
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:03,480
This piece will really

287
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:04,790
flatter your proportions.

288
00:15:04,790 --> 00:15:05,850
See? It reduces...

289
00:15:07,390 --> 00:15:09,000
What kind of garbage did you sell me?

290
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,000
I demand a refund!

291
00:15:11,670 --> 00:15:12,320
Everyone, gather around!

292
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:13,570
Come take a look!

293
00:15:13,670 --> 00:15:15,120
This shop sells junk!

294
00:15:16,050 --> 00:15:17,870
Don't buy clothes from them!

295
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:18,790
The clothes

296
00:15:18,790 --> 00:15:20,150
they're selling will kill you!

297
00:15:20,150 --> 00:15:20,720
Come, everyone!

298
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,660
Come take a look!

299
00:15:21,870 --> 00:15:23,500
You tell me who's in the wrong here.

300
00:15:23,500 --> 00:15:25,080
A couple of days ago, my daughter

301
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:26,540
bought some clothes here.

302
00:15:26,750 --> 00:15:28,290
After wearing them for just a few days,

303
00:15:28,290 --> 00:15:28,840
she broke out

304
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:31,330
in huge red rashes!

305
00:15:31,510 --> 00:15:32,720
All red and itchy!

306
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:34,790
I asked an expert,

307
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:35,860
and guess what?

308
00:15:36,030 --> 00:15:37,290
-What?
-Any findings?

309
00:15:37,510 --> 00:15:39,670
Those are discarded clothes from overseas!

310
00:15:39,670 --> 00:15:42,400
-Discarded clothes from overseas?
-Foreign clothing waste?

311
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:43,910
I heard such used clothing from overseas

312
00:15:43,910 --> 00:15:45,800
was stripped off dead people.

313
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:46,360
And

314
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:47,310
it's covered in

315
00:15:47,390 --> 00:15:48,440
germs and pathogens that cause

316
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,320
infectious diseases.

317
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:50,600
Exactly!

318
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,320
Aren't these clothes banned
in the market now?

319
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,920
Where did she get this stuff?

320
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:55,560
Ma'am!

321
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:56,960
Ma'am.

322
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:57,850
Come with m.e

323
00:15:58,550 --> 00:15:59,000
Ma'am,

324
00:15:59,510 --> 00:16:01,310
you sell clothes nearby, right?

325
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:03,390
You are a mother too, aren't you?

326
00:16:03,390 --> 00:16:03,850
Come on,

327
00:16:04,060 --> 00:16:05,230
you be the judge.

328
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,750
Whoever sells clothes like those

329
00:16:06,750 --> 00:16:08,550
has no conscience at all, right?

330
00:16:09,150 --> 00:16:10,270
How can we let this slide?

331
00:16:10,270 --> 00:16:11,240
Don't we deserve justice?

332
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:12,000
We can't let this slide!

333
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,030
She must be punished!

334
00:16:13,030 --> 00:16:14,150
This is unacceptable!

335
00:16:14,150 --> 00:16:15,120
Enough, enough!

336
00:16:15,630 --> 00:16:16,960
The truth is not out yet.

337
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:17,750
How can you just conclude

338
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:19,550
the problem lies in the clothes?

339
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:20,380
This...

340
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:23,320
Those clothes are worn next to the skin.

341
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,420
If not the clothes,

342
00:16:24,510 --> 00:16:25,750
where else could the problem be?

343
00:16:25,750 --> 00:16:27,270
-Exactly.
-She has a point.

344
00:16:27,270 --> 00:16:28,600
This shop must be investigated.

345
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:29,360
I am going to

346
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:30,450
tear down her shop

347
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,290
today!

348
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:31,720
I...

349
00:16:32,430 --> 00:16:33,690
Stay away from my shop!

350
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:34,970
You can't...

351
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,200
Don't touch my stuff!

352
00:16:38,840 --> 00:16:39,720
Stay away from my shop!

353
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:40,860
There's nothing wrong with my clothes.

354
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:41,890
How can you do this?

355
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:43,890
You can't... Don't touch my things!

356
00:16:47,510 --> 00:16:48,110
Let me see.

357
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:49,920
Her hair's all white.

358
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,870
The shop owner must be sick!

359
00:16:53,390 --> 00:16:54,240
What kind of illness is this?

360
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:56,020
Her hair's all white at this young age.

361
00:16:56,020 --> 00:16:57,480
Could it be a contagious disease?

362
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,480
Yes, contagious!

363
00:16:58,670 --> 00:16:59,870
Contagious? Hell no.

364
00:17:00,150 --> 00:17:01,950
Don't you have any common sense?

365
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:03,520
It's not contagious.

366
00:17:03,630 --> 00:17:04,780
I'm her blood sister.

367
00:17:04,780 --> 00:17:05,910
Do I look sick to you?

368
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,790
Listen, everyone, step back.

369
00:17:08,069 --> 00:17:09,030
Make way please.

370
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:11,160
Hello.

371
00:17:11,510 --> 00:17:12,750
We're market administrators of Wulin Road

372
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:13,869
Commercial Street.

373
00:17:13,869 --> 00:17:15,030
You said you were scammed
into buying foreign

374
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:16,160
clothing waste in our market, right?

375
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:16,680
Then come

376
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:18,079
with us
to the market administration office.

377
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:19,720
We'll get to the bottom of this.

378
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,180
I didn't ask for your help.

379
00:17:21,310 --> 00:17:21,920
This is...

380
00:17:23,060 --> 00:17:24,319
only a trivial matter.

381
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:25,970
You shouldn't be bothered.

382
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:27,270
A trivial matter?

383
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:29,810
The noise and disruption
you made in public

384
00:17:29,810 --> 00:17:30,960
have caused damage to this shopping

385
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:31,480
street...

386
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:31,790
Si.

387
00:17:31,790 --> 00:17:32,400
And the reputation

388
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,550
of this legally registered

389
00:17:33,550 --> 00:17:34,880
shop named All the Rage.

390
00:17:36,030 --> 00:17:36,760
Regardless,

391
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:40,020
you must come with us
for a thorough investigation.

392
00:17:40,550 --> 00:17:42,280
There are rules in this market.

393
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:44,920
Any fellow traders found maliciously

394
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,830
disrupting market order will be expelled

395
00:17:46,830 --> 00:17:47,890
without exception

396
00:17:48,510 --> 00:17:49,510
in serious cases.

397
00:17:50,510 --> 00:17:51,240
Come with us!

398
00:17:58,510 --> 00:17:59,070
Qi Shi.

399
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:01,720
Qi Shi.

400
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:02,850
Hold on!

401
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:03,720
Qi Shi.

402
00:18:06,510 --> 00:18:07,750
You said you bought from my shop,

403
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:08,240
right?

404
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:10,940
But only these are the clothes in my shop.

405
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:12,970
I sourced all my goods

406
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,680
through official channels in Shenguang.

407
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:15,270
I've carefully checked

408
00:18:15,270 --> 00:18:16,680
every piece of clothing

409
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:18,310
and tagged them all.

410
00:18:20,310 --> 00:18:22,350
I solemnly promise you all here,

411
00:18:22,730 --> 00:18:24,170
that if anyone buys

412
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,400
defective goods

413
00:18:25,420 --> 00:18:27,350
or foreign clothing waste from me,

414
00:18:27,590 --> 00:18:29,390
I'll pay you ten times the price!

415
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:31,720
So she really was framed.

416
00:18:33,770 --> 00:18:34,350
Alright.

417
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:36,100
Get a move on. Come with us.

418
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:37,750
Break it up, everyone.

419
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:38,720
Break it up.

420
00:18:38,830 --> 00:18:39,440
Off you go.

421
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:41,480
-Don't gather around.
-Break it up.

422
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:06,480
Dad told me

423
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,940
you opened a shop here too.

424
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:10,070
Isn't it a huge coincidence?

425
00:19:10,070 --> 00:19:11,880
My shop is on this street too.

426
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:14,480
It's right at the end of the street.

427
00:19:16,590 --> 00:19:18,790
Looks like I didn't do enough research.

428
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:20,490
I shouldn't have been lazy.

429
00:19:20,490 --> 00:19:22,200
At that time, I was just busy
building good relations

430
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:23,600
with neighboring shops.

431
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:25,880
I should have walked a bit further down.

432
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:28,030
That way, I would have
run into you earlier.

433
00:19:28,030 --> 00:19:29,160
Little did I imagine

434
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:32,400
that we'd end up in the same business.

435
00:19:33,830 --> 00:19:35,510
But a smart girl like you will surely

436
00:19:35,510 --> 00:19:37,170
succeed in everything you do.

437
00:19:40,030 --> 00:19:42,760
If you had continued
your education years ago...

438
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:43,640
Si,

439
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:46,250
compliment me all you want,

440
00:19:46,750 --> 00:19:48,310
but just don't bring up the past.

441
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:50,570
A true hero never dwells on past glories.

442
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,020
You don't blame me?

443
00:19:58,070 --> 00:19:59,680
I could blame anyone but you.

444
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:03,340
You didn't do anything wrong.

445
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,260
If I am to name one thing

446
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:08,440
that I've learned out here
over these years...

447
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:10,100
I'd say the most important one

448
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:12,080
is to never cling to the past.

449
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,330
We have to look forward.

450
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:16,010
You see,

451
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:18,270
our lives are

452
00:20:18,270 --> 00:20:20,200
getting better and better, right?

453
00:20:20,310 --> 00:20:21,370
For all it's worth,

454
00:20:21,550 --> 00:20:23,590
we're two beautiful shop owners
at opposite ends

455
00:20:23,590 --> 00:20:24,990
of this shopping street.

456
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:30,210
You've really grown up.

457
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:34,770
Talking to you takes me back

458
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,640
to when were kids,

459
00:20:37,020 --> 00:20:37,880
playing and messing around

460
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:39,030
in the yard.

461
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:40,820
Do you remember

462
00:20:41,270 --> 00:20:42,350
when you were little,

463
00:20:42,350 --> 00:20:44,250
you caught caterpillars to scare Cao Xin?

464
00:20:44,250 --> 00:20:45,350
He was so frightened that he

465
00:20:45,350 --> 00:20:46,750
couldn't sleep for days.

466
00:20:46,830 --> 00:20:49,360
He got really bad dark circles
under his eyes.

467
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:51,770
Are you two still in touch?

468
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:57,550
No, I've been too busy to talk to him.

469
00:20:58,720 --> 00:21:00,320
Si, did you bring your phone?

470
00:21:00,510 --> 00:21:01,400
Let's exchange numbers

471
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:02,660
so we can keep in touch.

472
00:21:09,790 --> 00:21:11,240
Breakfast is ready!

473
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:40,400
Doudou.

474
00:21:41,180 --> 00:21:42,400
How can you play with my phone again?

475
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:43,560
You should've stopped him.

476
00:21:43,560 --> 00:21:44,370
Hand it over.

477
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:45,350
Don't play with Mom's phone.

478
00:21:45,350 --> 00:21:46,310
Play with Dad's. Here.

479
00:21:46,310 --> 00:21:48,200
No playing with your phone either.

480
00:21:48,200 --> 00:21:48,750
Time to eat.

481
00:21:48,750 --> 00:21:49,770
Right, let's eat.

482
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:51,290
I'll go get chopsticks.

483
00:21:59,460 --> 00:22:00,400
I wonder how our son's

484
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:02,110
job hunt is going.

485
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:04,200
What's the rush?

486
00:22:04,510 --> 00:22:06,240
Why put so much pressure on him?

487
00:22:07,440 --> 00:22:09,030
Just let him take his time.

488
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:12,500
We should look on the bright side.

489
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:16,200
Look,

490
00:22:16,790 --> 00:22:19,010
before, he was completely
out of our sight.

491
00:22:19,010 --> 00:22:20,940
But now, he's back, safe and sound.

492
00:22:21,510 --> 00:22:22,370
So, be content.

493
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:24,920
Easy for you to say.

494
00:22:25,920 --> 00:22:27,000
Our son used to be

495
00:22:27,690 --> 00:22:28,560
so ambitious

496
00:22:28,590 --> 00:22:29,650
and full of spirit.

497
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:31,590
He aspired to be a world champion.

498
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:33,240
Everyone in the neighborhood

499
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:34,700
praised him, didn't they?

500
00:22:35,350 --> 00:22:36,480
And now look,

501
00:22:36,510 --> 00:22:38,030
he can't even find a job.

502
00:22:39,070 --> 00:22:40,550
Zhi never shows it

503
00:22:41,160 --> 00:22:42,690
because he's considerate.

504
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:43,160
You know?

505
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:44,820
Deep down, he must very upset.

506
00:22:46,270 --> 00:22:46,720
Well,

507
00:22:47,150 --> 00:22:48,310
our downstairs neighbor, Li,

508
00:22:48,310 --> 00:22:49,200
has a grandson

509
00:22:49,440 --> 00:22:50,830
who just returned from abroad.

510
00:22:50,830 --> 00:22:53,490
Isn't that young lad
also unemployed right now?

511
00:22:53,750 --> 00:22:54,960
Our son can't find a job

512
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:56,690
right away, and that's normal.

513
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:58,510
Neither have we found

514
00:22:58,510 --> 00:22:59,000
a proper business

515
00:22:59,000 --> 00:22:59,930
to do now, right?

516
00:23:00,030 --> 00:23:01,030
Isn't it the same?

517
00:23:02,070 --> 00:23:03,130
We moved all the way

518
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:04,850
from Qingwu to Haizhou.

519
00:23:05,880 --> 00:23:06,310
W-W-We

520
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:08,080
have spent so much money,

521
00:23:08,160 --> 00:23:09,800
with no revenue coming in.

522
00:23:09,830 --> 00:23:10,310
I...

523
00:23:12,690 --> 00:23:13,920
I checked out some storefronts

524
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:15,220
in Haizhou today.

525
00:23:16,350 --> 00:23:18,680
The rent is 10 times
higher than in Qingwu.

526
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:20,450
That much? That expensive?

527
00:23:25,590 --> 00:23:26,450
How about this?

528
00:23:27,030 --> 00:23:28,830
We'll go back to our old trade.

529
00:23:29,790 --> 00:23:31,590
Let our son run a street stall with me.

530
00:23:31,590 --> 00:23:32,350
Rest assured.

531
00:23:32,350 --> 00:23:33,720
I guarantee he won't starve

532
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:34,920
as long as I am around.

533
00:23:35,960 --> 00:23:37,030
Oh, cut it out.

534
00:23:37,250 --> 00:23:37,600
You...

535
00:23:37,600 --> 00:23:38,210
actually

536
00:23:38,240 --> 00:23:39,880
take pride in running a street stall?

537
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:40,830
Are you even looking for

538
00:23:40,830 --> 00:23:41,690
an heir or what?

539
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:44,650
Why? Anything wrong
with running a street stall?

540
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:45,750
Son,

541
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:46,920
you're back.

542
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:47,790
Yes, Mom, I'm back.

543
00:23:47,790 --> 00:23:49,030
Haven't eaten yet, have you?

544
00:23:49,030 --> 00:23:49,960
I'll go get you food.

545
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:51,070
No need, Mom. I...

546
00:23:51,210 --> 00:23:51,790
I-I-I

547
00:23:51,790 --> 00:23:52,370
already made

548
00:23:52,370 --> 00:23:53,200
dinner and kept it

549
00:23:53,200 --> 00:23:53,960
here for you.

550
00:23:56,070 --> 00:23:56,790
-Come on.
-Dad.

551
00:23:56,790 --> 00:23:57,640
Sit down and eat.

552
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:58,770
I bought some fruit.

553
00:23:59,400 --> 00:23:59,750
Okay.

554
00:24:00,830 --> 00:24:01,290
Come on.

555
00:24:01,510 --> 00:24:03,160
I steamed these buns today.

556
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:05,730
Have a bowl of porridge.

557
00:24:08,640 --> 00:24:09,000
Here.

558
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:10,550
Pickles.

559
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:12,840
We waited a long time for you.

560
00:24:15,350 --> 00:24:15,880
Mom, Dad,

561
00:24:16,350 --> 00:24:17,950
if I come back too late again,

562
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:18,750
don't wait for me.

563
00:24:18,750 --> 00:24:19,590
Just go to sleep.

564
00:24:19,590 --> 00:24:20,310
It's fine.

565
00:24:20,550 --> 00:24:22,350
Your mom and I have
nothing else to do anyway.

566
00:24:22,350 --> 00:24:22,790
Right.

567
00:24:22,830 --> 00:24:23,750
We were just chatting.

568
00:24:23,750 --> 00:24:24,160
Yes.

569
00:24:24,360 --> 00:24:25,890
We chatted as we watched TV.

570
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:31,480
Well, today I went

571
00:24:31,840 --> 00:24:32,790
to see my former coach

572
00:24:32,790 --> 00:24:34,110
from the sports school.

573
00:24:34,110 --> 00:24:36,010
He left the school the year before last

574
00:24:36,010 --> 00:24:36,930
and then set up

575
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:39,200
a comprehensive physical
training center for kids.

576
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:41,460
He told me to try working there tomorrow.

577
00:24:42,590 --> 00:24:45,120
Is he that former coach of yours,
surnamed Ma?

578
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:45,910
That's

579
00:24:46,110 --> 00:24:47,400
our son's former coach.

580
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:48,240
He ran around

581
00:24:48,270 --> 00:24:49,160
and helped a lot

582
00:24:49,180 --> 00:24:50,510
when Zhi was in trouble.

583
00:24:50,750 --> 00:24:51,480
Oh, Coach Ma.

584
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:54,060
T-Then make sure you do a good job.

585
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:54,960
I got it.

586
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:55,890
Don't worry.

587
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:56,890
I know what to do.

588
00:25:02,070 --> 00:25:03,730
Coach Ma, you wanted to see me?

589
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:05,300
From now on,

590
00:25:05,480 --> 00:25:07,540
you'll be teaching general fitness.

591
00:25:07,620 --> 00:25:08,160
Later on,

592
00:25:08,510 --> 00:25:09,590
go with Yang

593
00:25:09,830 --> 00:25:11,160
to sit in on some classes

594
00:25:12,110 --> 00:25:12,850
so as to learn

595
00:25:12,880 --> 00:25:13,980
how he teaches.

596
00:25:16,770 --> 00:25:18,160
Just relax!

597
00:25:18,510 --> 00:25:19,720
You've mastered

598
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:20,930
more than enough

599
00:25:21,350 --> 00:25:22,680
to teach some children.

600
00:25:25,090 --> 00:25:25,460
Now,

601
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:27,480
let us show you around the venue.

602
00:25:27,830 --> 00:25:28,750
Thank you, Coach.

603
00:25:28,750 --> 00:25:30,080
No problem. Just relax.

604
00:25:47,550 --> 00:25:49,270
On your toes. Then step forward.

605
00:25:49,270 --> 00:25:50,350
Here we go.

606
00:25:50,790 --> 00:25:52,250
That's right. Keep going.

607
00:25:52,790 --> 00:25:53,400
Continue.

608
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:55,000
Good. Now,

609
00:25:55,030 --> 00:25:56,590
let's review the starting position.

610
00:25:56,590 --> 00:25:57,310
One and a half foot lengths

611
00:25:57,310 --> 00:25:58,850
behind the starting line.

612
00:25:58,880 --> 00:26:00,160
Move this foot back a bit.

613
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:02,000
Alright. Now raise your hips.

614
00:26:02,030 --> 00:26:03,070
What's there to say?

615
00:26:03,070 --> 00:26:03,920
Get ready to run.

616
00:26:03,920 --> 00:26:04,880
Keep your hips up.

617
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,550
Stop it now.

618
00:26:06,300 --> 00:26:08,410
A parent of a child here

619
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:09,350
is from Qingwu.

620
00:26:09,720 --> 00:26:10,850
She recognized you.

621
00:26:12,270 --> 00:26:12,680
So...

622
00:26:13,070 --> 00:26:14,550
What kind of training school is this?

623
00:26:14,550 --> 00:26:15,950
You hired a teacher who's been to prison!

624
00:26:15,950 --> 00:26:18,100
How can we trust this kind of person

625
00:26:18,200 --> 00:26:19,360
with our child?

626
00:26:19,640 --> 00:26:20,400
Listen to me.

627
00:26:22,070 --> 00:26:23,130
Please hear me out.

628
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:24,960
Mr. Qi

629
00:26:25,310 --> 00:26:27,440
did run into a bit of trouble years ago.

630
00:26:27,590 --> 00:26:28,390
Nonetheless,

631
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:29,670
there's absolutely

632
00:26:29,720 --> 00:26:31,450
no problem with his character.

633
00:26:31,550 --> 00:26:32,830
His professional skills

634
00:26:32,830 --> 00:26:34,000
are second to none.

635
00:26:34,590 --> 00:26:35,160
He even won first place

636
00:26:35,160 --> 00:26:36,550
in the Provincial Games back in the day.

637
00:26:36,550 --> 00:26:37,500
I don't care for that!

638
00:26:37,500 --> 00:26:38,070
All I know is

639
00:26:38,070 --> 00:26:39,000
that he's an ex-convict.

640
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:40,400
Winning first place
in the Provincial Games

641
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:41,680
or nationals means nothing.

642
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:42,310
Let me ask you.

643
00:26:42,310 --> 00:26:43,480
Is he an ex-convict or not?

644
00:26:43,480 --> 00:26:44,400
It's just unacceptable

645
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:45,590
that you assign an ex-convict

646
00:26:45,590 --> 00:26:47,030
to teach our child.

647
00:26:47,160 --> 00:26:47,820
Okay, fine.

648
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:49,400
How about this?

649
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:51,000
This training center

650
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:51,920
would like to make

651
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:53,200
a gesture of benevolence

652
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:54,840
by offering you a 10% discount

653
00:26:54,840 --> 00:26:56,550
on this semester's tuition fees.

654
00:26:56,550 --> 00:26:58,160
Who cares about that little discount?

655
00:26:58,160 --> 00:26:59,310
Today, you will have to either

656
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:00,640
assign a different coach
or give us a refund!

657
00:27:00,640 --> 00:27:01,110
Exactly!

658
00:27:01,110 --> 00:27:01,720
B-B-But...

659
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:02,500
I'm telling you,

660
00:27:02,500 --> 00:27:03,610
we're quitting.

661
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:05,000
Training centers like yours

662
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:05,830
can be seen everywhere.

663
00:27:05,830 --> 00:27:06,200
Yes!

664
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:06,880
We demand a refund!

665
00:27:06,880 --> 00:27:10,310
-Refund!
-We demand a refund!

666
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:11,830
Coach.

667
00:27:12,310 --> 00:27:13,570
P-Please listen to me.

668
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:14,960
I know you've been

669
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:16,440
helping me all these years.

670
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:17,790
I can't repay you with much.

671
00:27:17,790 --> 00:27:18,310
But at least

672
00:27:18,310 --> 00:27:19,720
I shouldn't cause you any more trouble.

673
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:20,960
I-It's fine. I'll talk to them...

674
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:22,160
Please let me finish.

675
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:23,760
With how things are today,

676
00:27:23,760 --> 00:27:24,220
I have to leave,

677
00:27:24,220 --> 00:27:25,950
or the parents won't calm down.

678
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:27,310
Sorry.

679
00:27:28,410 --> 00:27:29,790
And thank you.
My apologies for all this trouble.

680
00:27:29,790 --> 00:27:30,390
I'm sorry.

681
00:27:32,590 --> 00:27:33,110
Let me.

682
00:27:33,350 --> 00:27:34,080
Parents,

683
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:35,320
I'm sorry.

684
00:27:35,350 --> 00:27:36,200
I'll be leaving right now.

685
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:36,720
My apologies

686
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:38,070
for causing such trouble.

687
00:27:38,070 --> 00:27:39,240
Get a move on. Go away!

688
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:40,110
-Leave already!
-Off you go!

689
00:27:40,110 --> 00:27:40,750
Get lost!

690
00:27:40,770 --> 00:27:42,050
-Leave!
-Seriously.

691
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:45,060
You always refused to meet with me

692
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:46,700
when you were behind bars.

693
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:49,140
Now, you're finally free.

694
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:52,610
Yet you still wouldn't come see me.

695
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:57,810
I meant to meet with you,

696
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:02,940
but I didn't have the guts.

697
00:29:04,550 --> 00:29:07,210
It was my fault
that you didn't get into college.

698
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:08,460
You should hate me.

699
00:29:13,090 --> 00:29:13,640
Qi Zhi,

700
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:14,530
you're taking yourself

701
00:29:14,530 --> 00:29:15,640
way too seriously.

702
00:29:17,590 --> 00:29:18,840
With my grades,

703
00:29:19,790 --> 00:29:20,750
do you really think

704
00:29:20,750 --> 00:29:23,210
you could be an obstacle
on my way to college?

705
00:29:23,750 --> 00:29:24,640
I do hate you.

706
00:29:26,140 --> 00:29:27,270
I hate you so much.

707
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:31,320
I hate you for throwing away

708
00:29:31,550 --> 00:29:34,010
your bright future
in the heat of the moment.

709
00:29:34,130 --> 00:29:35,640
I hate you for not even bothering

710
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:37,640
to come see me after leaving prison.

711
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:39,520
Have you

712
00:29:39,550 --> 00:29:41,270
forgotten me, your own sister?

713
00:29:41,270 --> 00:29:41,870
No.

714
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:43,000
I swear I haven't.

715
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:53,420
It's true that I didn't get into college.

716
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,260
That's my fate.

717
00:29:58,110 --> 00:29:59,510
But I refuse to accept it.

718
00:30:00,790 --> 00:30:02,190
I've never given in to it.

719
00:30:05,110 --> 00:30:05,910
Look at me now.

720
00:30:06,550 --> 00:30:07,550
I have made it

721
00:30:07,840 --> 00:30:08,520
in Haizhou

722
00:30:08,550 --> 00:30:09,680
all by myself.

723
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:11,300
What about you?

724
00:30:13,180 --> 00:30:14,780
Have you accepted your fate?

725
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:17,730
Well, you've admitted defeat.

726
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:21,430
I never meant to do so.

727
00:30:23,070 --> 00:30:24,800
But you see what's going on now.

728
00:30:25,970 --> 00:30:26,560
Nobody

729
00:30:26,590 --> 00:30:27,790
will hire an ex-con.

730
00:30:30,350 --> 00:30:32,550
The way you behave now truly maddens me.

731
00:30:32,980 --> 00:30:33,880
It's just a job, right?

732
00:30:33,880 --> 00:30:35,920
If one way doesn't work, then try another.

733
00:30:35,920 --> 00:30:37,720
Why do you have to be so sulky?

734
00:30:37,750 --> 00:30:38,480
Does it help?

735
00:31:01,640 --> 00:31:02,970
Ever since I was little,

736
00:31:05,160 --> 00:31:06,420
because of my illness,

737
00:31:07,510 --> 00:31:08,640
I've suffered much

738
00:31:09,310 --> 00:31:10,310
pain and disdain.

739
00:31:12,310 --> 00:31:13,840
But have I ever complained?

740
00:31:15,510 --> 00:31:17,440
I made it through at last, didn't I?

741
00:31:18,040 --> 00:31:18,680
Look at me now.

742
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:20,080
Aren't I doing just fine?

743
00:31:22,310 --> 00:31:23,640
I'm even doubting if...

744
00:31:24,790 --> 00:31:26,850
if we truly are biological siblings.

745
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:29,850
How come you're nothing like me at all?

746
00:31:45,590 --> 00:31:46,650
Show some respect.

747
00:31:47,030 --> 00:31:49,560
If anything, you're the one
who's not like me.

748
00:31:57,880 --> 00:31:59,920
The fact is I'm not changing
to another path.

749
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:01,850
I simply have no paths choose from.

750
00:32:15,790 --> 00:32:16,520
I don't think

751
00:32:17,030 --> 00:32:18,430
your failure to find a job

752
00:32:19,510 --> 00:32:21,250
is largely related to you being

753
00:32:21,510 --> 00:32:22,370
an ex-convict.

754
00:32:23,830 --> 00:32:24,890
We're in adversity

755
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:28,670
due to lack of education.

756
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:31,460
I'm just not cut out

757
00:32:32,030 --> 00:32:32,830
for studies.

758
00:32:33,550 --> 00:32:34,580
You know that.

759
00:32:34,790 --> 00:32:35,720
Since I was a kid,

760
00:32:35,830 --> 00:32:37,770
even reading a manual
could make me sleepy.

761
00:32:37,770 --> 00:32:38,640
Yeah, right.

762
00:32:39,680 --> 00:32:41,640
I'm not asking you to take that path.

763
00:32:41,640 --> 00:32:43,200
Only I am the scholar of the family.

764
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:44,200
I won't force you.

765
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:45,000
I know.

766
00:32:46,830 --> 00:32:48,550
Whether it was school back then

767
00:32:48,550 --> 00:32:49,480
or work now,

768
00:32:50,160 --> 00:32:52,020
my sister can always hold her own.

769
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:59,800
I put you through so much misery.

770
00:33:03,000 --> 00:33:04,600
Instead of kowtowing to you,

771
00:33:05,200 --> 00:33:06,460
let me make an apology.

772
00:33:06,550 --> 00:33:07,160
I'm sorry.

773
00:33:38,110 --> 00:33:39,710
You can deliver goods for me.

774
00:33:40,140 --> 00:33:41,000
Deliver goods?

775
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:47,170
I opened a store

776
00:33:47,780 --> 00:33:48,670
in Haizhou.

777
00:33:49,680 --> 00:33:51,540
I can't manage everything alone.

778
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:00,590
What now?

779
00:34:01,770 --> 00:34:02,880
Feeling too embarrassed to work

780
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:03,830
for your own sister?

781
00:34:03,830 --> 00:34:05,290
No. That's not what I mean.

782
00:34:06,270 --> 00:34:07,070
Delivery guys

783
00:34:07,830 --> 00:34:09,760
should know how to drive cars, right?

784
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:10,480
But I don't.

785
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:12,530
I'm afraid I'll get in your way.

786
00:34:14,190 --> 00:34:15,650
Then go and learn to drive.

787
00:34:17,190 --> 00:34:17,800
Gosh.

788
00:34:22,110 --> 00:34:24,170
Thank you for your support, Mr. Wang.

789
00:34:24,190 --> 00:34:25,440
-Goodbye.
-Keep up the good work.

790
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:26,040
Take care.

791
00:34:26,920 --> 00:34:27,949
See Mr. Wang out for me.

792
00:34:27,949 --> 00:34:28,840
This way, Mr. Wang.

793
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:29,300
Please.

794
00:34:34,150 --> 00:34:34,679
Let's go.

795
00:34:37,030 --> 00:34:38,630
Indeed, young people are

796
00:34:39,110 --> 00:34:39,840
really bold.

797
00:34:41,110 --> 00:34:42,030
I made a right choice

798
00:34:42,030 --> 00:34:43,190
by hiring you as my assistant

799
00:34:43,190 --> 00:34:44,920
out of hundreds of candidates.

800
00:34:45,230 --> 00:34:46,280
How did you come up with

801
00:34:46,280 --> 00:34:47,400
the idea of changing our long-standing

802
00:34:47,400 --> 00:34:48,460
allocation system

803
00:34:48,550 --> 00:34:50,000
to an ordering fair?

804
00:34:50,330 --> 00:34:51,150
I thought it this way:

805
00:34:51,150 --> 00:34:53,320
distributors are on the front line
of the industry.

806
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:54,280
They are the ones who understand

807
00:34:54,280 --> 00:34:55,480
consumer needs best.

808
00:34:56,199 --> 00:34:57,230
A bottom-up approach

809
00:34:57,230 --> 00:34:58,590
to style selection can

810
00:34:59,230 --> 00:35:01,110
most effectively minimize inventory

811
00:35:01,110 --> 00:35:03,000
and deliver win-win outcomes
to both the brand and distributors.

812
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:03,600
Well said.

813
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:05,630
But it's not easy

814
00:35:05,630 --> 00:35:06,550
to implement

815
00:35:06,710 --> 00:35:07,770
a whole new system.

816
00:35:08,880 --> 00:35:09,630
How about this?

817
00:35:09,630 --> 00:35:10,510
In three days,

818
00:35:10,800 --> 00:35:11,190
submit

819
00:35:11,190 --> 00:35:12,560
a feasibility study report to me.

820
00:35:12,560 --> 00:35:13,620
Is there a problem?

821
00:35:15,440 --> 00:35:16,770
I can make it in two days.

822
00:35:17,320 --> 00:35:18,670
Very good. A promising future awaits you.

823
00:35:18,670 --> 00:35:19,870
Keep up the good work.

824
00:35:30,000 --> 00:35:30,440
Oh, right.

825
00:35:30,440 --> 00:35:31,480
My father fell ill.

826
00:35:31,480 --> 00:35:32,550
He needs a substitute teacher

827
00:35:32,550 --> 00:35:34,060
for his English class this week.

828
00:35:34,060 --> 00:35:35,190
Are you interested?

829
00:35:44,590 --> 00:35:45,110
Qi Shi,

830
00:35:45,590 --> 00:35:46,590
be honest with me.

831
00:35:46,960 --> 00:35:49,190
Are you wearing colored contacts or not?

832
00:35:49,190 --> 00:35:51,720
This is the natural color of my eyes.
Jealous?

833
00:35:53,280 --> 00:35:55,080
Such a pretty color of your eyes.

834
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:56,800
They seem like a foreigner's.

835
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:58,480
But I have poor eyesight.

836
00:36:01,710 --> 00:36:03,340
Did you take notes last class?

837
00:36:03,340 --> 00:36:04,360
Can I copy them?

838
00:36:04,480 --> 00:36:05,000
Sure.

839
00:36:06,710 --> 00:36:07,800
Great. Thanks.

840
00:36:08,800 --> 00:36:09,590
Look, guys!

841
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:11,460
What a handsome young man!

842
00:36:14,030 --> 00:36:14,920
He's so cute!

843
00:36:14,920 --> 00:36:15,510
Look!

844
00:36:15,630 --> 00:36:16,420
A handsome man!

845
00:36:16,420 --> 00:36:17,290
I can't see him.

846
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:20,670
Sir,

847
00:36:20,920 --> 00:36:22,620
did you walk into the wrong classroom?

848
00:36:22,620 --> 00:36:23,480
Our English teacher

849
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:25,280
is hardly as handsome as you are.

850
00:36:26,590 --> 00:36:28,520
Hello everyone, my name is Cao Xin.

851
00:36:28,600 --> 00:36:29,840
Your English teacher had

852
00:36:29,840 --> 00:36:30,590
a little emergency today.

853
00:36:30,590 --> 00:36:31,710
So I'm subbing for him in this class.

854
00:36:31,710 --> 00:36:32,310
Handsome,

855
00:36:32,670 --> 00:36:34,010
don't just sub for him in one class.

856
00:36:34,010 --> 00:36:34,630
You should take over

857
00:36:34,630 --> 00:36:35,590
all our future classes.

858
00:36:35,590 --> 00:36:38,000
-Yes!
-Go ahead and do it!

859
00:36:38,380 --> 00:36:39,760
Your English teacher is well-connected.

860
00:36:39,760 --> 00:36:41,090
I dare not steal his job.

861
00:36:41,120 --> 00:36:42,360
Now, let's review what you learned

862
00:36:42,360 --> 00:36:43,620
in the previous class.

863
00:36:43,710 --> 00:36:45,310
Can one of you recap it for us?

864
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:00,880
Qi Shi.

865
00:37:06,070 --> 00:37:07,070
Is Qi Shi not here?

866
00:37:09,510 --> 00:37:10,080
Qi Shi,

867
00:37:10,590 --> 00:37:12,250
the teacher's asking for you.

868
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,680
Please tell me your name.

869
00:37:51,760 --> 00:37:53,360
My name is Qi Shi.

870
00:37:57,000 --> 00:37:58,250
My name is Cao Xin.

871
00:38:00,480 --> 00:38:01,410
Nice to meet you.

872
00:38:08,030 --> 00:38:11,630
Nice to meet you... too.

873
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:20,070
Can you tell me about yourself?

874
00:38:23,840 --> 00:38:25,070
I'm Qi Shi.

875
00:38:26,800 --> 00:38:28,960
I come from a small village

876
00:38:30,510 --> 00:38:31,920
called Qingwu Town.

877
00:38:33,880 --> 00:38:35,480
I'm 22 years old.

878
00:38:40,070 --> 00:38:41,330
Why do you come here...

879
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:44,070
to learn Business English?

880
00:38:46,510 --> 00:38:48,650
Because I want to improve myself

881
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:52,630
and communicate with foreigners,

882
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:57,320
especially the talented ones.

883
00:39:01,400 --> 00:39:03,000
What's your highest degree?

884
00:39:06,320 --> 00:39:06,760
Sorry.

885
00:39:08,280 --> 00:39:09,210
Next question.

886
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:13,110
I haven't been to college.

887
00:39:27,930 --> 00:39:31,890
♪ The wind blew through our hair ♪

888
00:39:34,580 --> 00:39:38,250
♪ The story slowly grew complicated ♪

889
00:39:41,240 --> 00:39:46,250
♪ We didn't become anyone's legend ♪

890
00:39:47,170 --> 00:39:52,250
♪ We only learned to grow up in the rain ♪

891
00:39:50,910 --> 00:39:51,920
How have you been?

892
00:39:54,910 --> 00:39:58,500
♪ Are we to blame fate? ♪

893
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:05,050
♪ Adulthood is bandaging your own fall ♪

894
00:40:04,670 --> 00:40:05,440
I'm good.

895
00:40:07,660 --> 00:40:10,700
♪ Rented rooms, the last bus home ♪

896
00:40:10,730 --> 00:40:12,960
♪ What does the future hold? ♪

897
00:40:12,280 --> 00:40:13,320
No, I'm not.

898
00:40:13,580 --> 00:40:18,250
♪ It's been long since I last had
the guts to say I feared ♪

899
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:17,920
I had...

900
00:40:21,030 --> 00:40:22,440
really hard times.

901
00:40:21,730 --> 00:40:25,110
♪ Though we have nothing,
we still bustle about ♪

902
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:28,480
My first job fired me

903
00:40:27,820 --> 00:40:32,120
♪ Because the answer is clear
as long as you are around ♪

904
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:31,670
because of my education,

905
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:35,440
and of my...

906
00:40:34,200 --> 00:40:36,300
♪ The old dreams are now covered in dust ♪

907
00:40:36,330 --> 00:40:38,780
♪ But it's okay ♪

908
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:38,280
my condition.

909
00:40:41,130 --> 00:40:46,590
♪ The morning glow will finally arrive ♪

910
00:40:56,230 --> 00:41:00,510
Then, I was selling clothes in the street,

911
00:41:02,880 --> 00:41:10,800
where I got kicked around here and there,
trying to earn money.

912
00:41:13,800 --> 00:41:15,020
Finally, I...

913
00:41:16,920 --> 00:41:17,590
own

914
00:41:17,590 --> 00:41:18,630
my shop now.

915
00:41:21,260 --> 00:41:27,330
♪ All I see is the look in your eyes ♪

916
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:32,580
♪ If there's nothing left tomorrow ♪

917
00:41:33,440 --> 00:41:34,670
It's been a long,

918
00:41:34,810 --> 00:41:45,500
♪ I'll still walk you home ♪

919
00:41:36,230 --> 00:41:40,550
long, and difficult time.

920
00:41:44,670 --> 00:41:45,840
But I made it.

921
00:41:59,300 --> 00:42:01,940
Sit down, please.

922
00:42:20,930 --> 00:42:21,440
That's all

923
00:42:21,440 --> 00:42:22,500
for today's class.

924
00:42:24,150 --> 00:42:25,350
See you, if possible.

925
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:26,710
Sir,

926
00:42:27,110 --> 00:42:28,760
can we have your email address?

927
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:30,150
This way, we can ask you questions

928
00:42:30,150 --> 00:42:31,190
in the future.

929
00:42:33,110 --> 00:42:33,760
Sir,

930
00:42:34,050 --> 00:42:34,880
do be generous.

931
00:42:34,880 --> 00:42:36,670
Please give us your email address.

932
00:42:36,670 --> 00:42:37,200
Goodbye.

933
00:42:38,920 --> 00:42:39,450
Qi Shi...

934
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:40,120
I have it—

935
00:42:41,840 --> 00:42:42,900
his email address.

936
00:42:43,630 --> 00:42:44,760
Give me ten yuan and it's yours.

937
00:42:44,760 --> 00:42:46,550
-I want it!
-I want it too!

938
00:42:46,570 --> 00:42:47,450
-Me too!
-Quick!

939
00:42:47,450 --> 00:42:48,030
Count me in!

940
00:42:48,030 --> 00:42:49,550
Fifty yuan for his QQ number.

941
00:42:49,550 --> 00:42:50,280
If you pay me a hundred,

942
00:42:50,280 --> 00:42:51,440
I'll tell you

943
00:42:51,460 --> 00:42:52,480
his phone number too.

944
00:42:52,480 --> 00:42:52,920
Okay.

945
00:42:52,940 --> 00:42:54,510
-I'll pay!
-I'll take that bundle!

946
00:42:54,510 --> 00:42:55,630
-Me first!
-No, me!

947
00:42:55,650 --> 00:42:56,600
I want both numbers.

948
00:42:56,600 --> 00:42:57,680
But not right now.

949
00:42:57,710 --> 00:42:59,110
You have to pay up first.

950
00:42:59,140 --> 00:43:00,870
Let me mark down your names now.

951
00:43:00,960 --> 00:43:02,760
-Put my name down first!
-Mine first!
